Falsifies `capability_manifest_note::verification::decode_subtree_grants_never_panics`.

The defect: `decode_subtree_grants` reads the version and then trusts the length, so a descriptor
of four to seven bytes that names the right version is read past its end.

Expected to fail: an index out of bounds in `decode_subtree_grants`.

